message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
type: software
title: NeoMundi Evidence — public verifier and gateway
abstract: >-
  Public, offline verifier for NeoMundi Evidence archives, attestations and OpenTimestamps proofs, together with the gateway that forwards submissions to the Evidence engine. Verification establishes the integrity of a record and reports explicitly what could not be tested; it does not establish that the underlying AI output was true.
